  "releaseNotes": "- **Built against the renamed `SyncOrAsyncCE.ToCompletedTaskFunc` of Compze.Internals.SystemCE, which was `AsAsync`:** the released version calls the old name, which the new Compze.Internals.SystemCE no longer has, and would fail beside it with a `MissingMethodException`. Nothing else changed.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.DependencyInjection 0.10.0-alpha (was 0.9.0-alpha), Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.10.0-internal (was 0.8.0-internal), Compze.Threading 0.13.0-alpha (was 0.12.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
